  "<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>Dice & Cube</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\n\nYou can obtain Play Passes needed to play Dice & Cube by completing minigames in Kamurocho.\n\nSo get your game on and take a trip to virtual Kamurocho!": "",
  "You can now play Puzzle Shogi in the sewers.": "",
  "<color=striking>Pause Menu <symbol=case_file_right_arrow> Fly the Drone Using the Drone App</color>\n\n<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>Flight</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\nTake command of the drone.\n\n<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>Customize</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\nCustomize your drone's various parts.\n* Currently unavailable.\n\n<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>Race Record</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\nCheck the Drone League records.\n* Currently unavailable.\n\n<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>Operation</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\nDon't like how it flies? Change the controls!": "",
  "Show Her How Much You Care\nBefore you go for a night on the town, you can buy your date a present at Le Marche. If you give her a present that suits her particular tastes, your intimacy will increase. And depending on how much she likes the present, your Intimacy Gauge may fill up immensely. So what it boils down to is this: if you're terrible with words, you can somewhat make up for it by giving her something special.": "",
  "<symbol=case_file_lower_than><color=striking>　Warning　</color><symbol=case_file_greater_than>\nThings are going to get <color=striking>pretty intense</color> from here on, so if there's anything you want to do, now is the time. It might be a good idea to <color=striking>save your game</color> too. Just in case. This is almost the end of the story, so settle in for the climactic finale. It could take a while, so if you need sleep, continue at your own discretion. You can save along the way, but once you start, <color=striking>you can't go back</color>, so consider making a separate save.": "",
